# capture-heartbeat: daglig sjekk av filehub memory-capture liveness.
# Aktiveres av Phase 500 deploy.sh (regenererer claude-bruker sin crontab fra cron.d/*.cron).
# Format: standard user-crontab (5-field, ingen user-felt - deploy.sh konkatenerer til claude sin crontab).
# Tidspunkt: 19:00 norsk lokal-tid - 1t buffer etter filehub capture-cron 18:00 (cross-ref nedenfor).
#
# Pair with dev-environment scripts/memory/memory-capture.cron (must run >=1h
# after that; window is 25h per PLAN-memory-pipeline-hardening Phase 200).
# capture-heartbeat.sh exit-er alltid 0; alarmer gar via Telegram-notify-stack.

0 19 * * * /home/claude/foundry/_shared/capture-heartbeat.sh
